id: minion-mark-first-effect
name: Minion Mark
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: minion-mark
fromEffect: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Minion Mark's first effect, as a Maneuver: one of your Minions, not Special, becomes a Marked Minion.
text: >
  (1)-[1/Round, Ruling]: As an Instant Maneuver, select one of your Minions that is not a Special Minion. That Minion becomes a ‘Marked Minion’. A Marked Minion loses 4(bT) Life Points at the start of each Combat Round, but their Combat Rolls are increased by 1(bT) – both use your Tier of Power for calculation.

---

# Which of your Minions, not Special and not Marked, asked - the mark with your base Tier as its stacks (chat.mjs markMinion).
[on used]
markMinion();
